Description: Bridge the PRIMARY selection between Xwayland and Wayland
 Mir's Xwayland support only syncs CLIPBOARD, so text selected in an X11 app
 can't be middle-click pasted into a Wayland app and vice versa. Parameterise
 XWaylandClipboardSource/Provider by the X11 selection atom and run a second
 pair for PRIMARY against the primary selection clipboard that
 zwp_primary_selection_device_manager_v1 already uses.
Author: Umoja developers
Forwarded: no

